WEBVTT

00:00:59.315 --> 00:01:01.790
They can listen and join the conversation.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:04.990
In fact, they have more control over the loss of control

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.380
than ever before.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.430
They can design for it. But how?

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:13.996
First of all, they can give employees and customers more control.

00:01:13.996 --> 00:01:17.392
They can collaborate with them on the creation of ideas,

00:01:17.392 --> 00:01:20.770
knowledge, content, designs and product.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.218
They can give them more control over pricing,

00:01:23.218 --> 00:01:25.178
which is what the band Radiohead did

00:01:25.178 --> 00:01:28.252
with its pay-as-you-like online release of its album

00:01:28.252 --> 00:01:31.200
"In Rainbows." Buyers could determine the price,